@@s032 Connecting everything at minimum cost → MST. Write: <i>"Sort the edges by non-decreasing weight. Add an edge if its endpoints are in different components (union-find). The result is a minimum spanning tree by the cut property. Time O(m log n)."</i>
@@s033 If the question asks to <b>prove</b> the correctness, cite the cut property and do the exchange argument on the discarded edge.
